Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:12.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:19.00,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:25.37,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:31.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:48.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:55.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:01:01.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.65,0:01:07.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:13.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:25.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫日暮戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出生于一个历史很悠久很古老的神社里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个非常平凡的国三女生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过就在我十五岁生日那天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神社的井里突然出现了一个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我带回到了战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.45,0:01:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在那里遇到了一个半妖少年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他名叫犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有可以增强妖怪法力的宝玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.93,0:02:14.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了跟犬夜叉他们一起寻找散落各处的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始来往于现代与战国之间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想借四魂之玉的力量满足自己的欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.99,0:02:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫奈落的妖怪\N为了从犬夜叉的哥哥杀生丸的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到完美的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意将杀生丸引进奈落城里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正当奈落打算吞了杀生丸\N将他化成自己的一部分的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.07,0:02:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉偏偏破了奈落的结界 跑进奈落城来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.47,0:02:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:54.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:03:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在最后出招了结他的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为能从我手里逃走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落利用珊瑚的弟弟琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种卑鄙手段 趁机逃之夭夭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我们的面前消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:20.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第82话 奔波于现代与战国之间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恶了 奈落那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:30.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道以后他都不再回这座城了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然结界都被你破除了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再移动城堡也就毫无意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的话 说不定真的可以砍死奈落这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只差一步就可以杀了他了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:05.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好啊 能回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能回到了这个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻轻松松的念书了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉有点对不起犬夜叉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:19.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道大家现在正在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个公式后天一定会考哦 大家要牢牢的记住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…模拟考
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都什么时候了 还在担心别人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:40.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩两天 要是不赶快抱抱佛脚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候恐怕要补考那就惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 可以走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你啦 借我笔记本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:53.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呐…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们自己也要复习呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于那拜托一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只借一下就还给你们总可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你这么弱不禁风一天到晚生病
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很糟糕的说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你们一定会帮我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就拿去影印一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就还给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你没办法 见你说得这么可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就谢谢咯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开动了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在胡思乱想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想什么还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是那个 爱吃醋的小太保是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:47.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想别的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别装了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他到底怎么样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事到底怎么样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你发展到什么程度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天才见过他哥哥而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:05:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说见过他哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他哥哥恐怕也是太保吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:03.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他哥哥也很厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他哥哥应该更厉害一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们兄弟俩只要一碰面经常都会打架呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:13.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很危险的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是很危险的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你打算继续这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心你将来吃亏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒认为爱可以克服一切障碍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇我支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我借走笔记了 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大学生正在考试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家的目的都跟戈薇一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么办？要去排队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是影印去哪里都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到其他地方去印吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么到处都这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞么鬼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是些没有义气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢死了 戈薇那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说好了 马上就会回来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:27.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说过要在那边待两三天才回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 稍安勿躁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么每一个人都好像没事一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落从我们手中跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:36.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是第一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:42.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也应该让自己休息一下比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不像你们人类一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不觉得疲倦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们都跟着你走的话 我们就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己累了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的邪气仍然躲在阴暗处
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那以后 我一直让那些死魂虫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找他那股邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次连它张开结界的迹象都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种程度的邪气…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟是怎么藏起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:35.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上从琥珀身上取下四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:43.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还以为这个小子只是个普通的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:46.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他却没有杀了那小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有被杀生丸给杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再这么继续反抗奈落下去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你恐怕没多少日子可活了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我也没资格说别人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:24.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连琥珀也一起不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来弥勒法师特地去安慰珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇早就跟我说过\N珊瑚一定在偷偷期待琥珀回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 我可以坐过一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在担心你弟弟的事对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:08.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:12.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么说有点强人所难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你真的要放宽心才好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我能够了解你的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 你是不是想一个人静一静
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要说的就这些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样 法师大人那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借着安慰人家 然后做出一些色狼的行为…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果等待着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不早点跟我说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊~~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的声音特别清脆好听
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个都只会偷懒 一点都不知道上进
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:02.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 读书还是要靠自己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.08,0:11:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候就应该
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 请问哲子在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问也是一个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:21.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.19,0:11:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么打这个电话啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 你的课本
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果昨天一整天什么都没有做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 姐姐 告诉你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要和我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.61,0:11:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会忘记好不容易记住的东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何今天我一定要记住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗哥哥他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你太慢了 我就来接你了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:11:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 马上跟我回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那里说什么梦话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就要考试了！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在生什么气啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:09.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听好 绝对不可以到外面去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖待在家里你听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:15.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 我傍晚就回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇忘了把便当带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便当
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:30.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我送过去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要沿着戈薇身上的气味找
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定很快可以追上她的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙 马上给我抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚 全都给我闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你活得不耐烦了是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:22.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来戈薇她们这个时代也安全不到哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次又怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在发什么呆啊 快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看什么看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是耳朵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大哥哥 谢谢你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 这世界怎么乱成这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么事啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉怎么会在这里出现呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:22.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚是你叫坐下的吧 麻烦你站起来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:44.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出门前不是跟你说过 叫你千万不要出门
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有人托我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:51.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人托你来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的便当耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道专程替我送便当来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.74,0:16:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都挤成一堆了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在家里 我肯定无法集中注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:20.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少在天黑前我得待在图书馆里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不快点念就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的肋间神经痛好多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在还年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以应该多注意保重你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一些对健康有益的食谱 是我特别搜集来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿回去试一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条这个人真的好细心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.15,0:16:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我没有想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:17:00.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以向北条同学借笔记来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.51,0:17:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 突然想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个中药偏方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说对各种病都很有帮助呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 戈薇同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:31.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体健康呢最重要的是情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要让自己的生活有规律
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三餐也要定时定量哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇同学 记得一定要吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:47.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果我还是没有借到他的笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐  快看！快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像刚刚说的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:08.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一位身穿红衣身轻如燕的少年
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙抓住了银行抢匪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.06,0:18:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不止这样 这位少年还救了\N一个来不急逃离火海的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据被救的小女孩形容\N这就是那位年轻人的画像
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:30.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是刚刚我戴的帽子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:32.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去学校之前你到底做过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来...这个箱子是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这么忙的时候还…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 你进来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:02.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我陪犬夜叉哥哥玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.61,0:19:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 我们去泡澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:18.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好烫 搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不能出去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥皂都还没有冲掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆 我不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.37,0:19:26.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你出去你听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 戈…薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公式又忘得一干二净了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚饭要吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舌头好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给他吃咖哩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是太辣了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛 痛 痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你自己像饿死鬼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:56.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到东西就往嘴里塞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？ 我可没有吵着你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样一直安静的看着我 反而感觉不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:24.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你还是躺下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:25.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苯蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是应该看着前面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真读书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们要回去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子 难道真打算整晚都盯着我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:41.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当然可以做到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是精力旺盛的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然睡着了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不晓得这小子搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给我的学习添了这么多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这样的睡面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是第一次看见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也对~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实最辛苦的人是犬夜叉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.53,0:21:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少今天晚上可以安心的睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他们回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 原来你昨天晚上在戈薇家过夜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.53,0:21:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是都怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:22:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你昨天晚上整晚都霸占我的床
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且连模拟考都考砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 太倒霉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好天气啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.55,0:22:22.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.39,0:22:29.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.50,0:22:35.53,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:41.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.11,0:22:48.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:55.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:23:02.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:09.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.64,0:23:16.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:22.94,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:29.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:36.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.84,0:23:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始发问
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片根本不在奈落手里\N你说会是谁拿走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我数数 在琥珀背上有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇手里还有三个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.52,0:23:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停 时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.78,0:24:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的钢牙 两只脚上也有两个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一钢牙也被奈落抓到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 奈落现在不知道躲到什么地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.83,0:24:07.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么… 那又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族少女和月虹的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说妖狼族少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别忘了还有钢牙呢
